{"unit_id": "chinazkk__dsh-console#feature-1", "repo": "chinazkk/dsh-console", "commit": "e3e395da437a67336b78463cccfbf62063e50fc0", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-console 的功能「会话内终端」：在 DSH 对话主视图挂载控制台面板，并为每个终端标签创建独立 xterm 实例。点击新建按钮即可启动终端并输入命令。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/client/index.ts:35-66", "src/client/index.ts:233-254"]}
